safeloadai-runtime 0.1.0
========================

This package redistributes one unmodified third-party binary as package data:

  File:     safeloadai_runtime/python-3.12.0.wasm
  What:     CPython 3.12.0 compiled to WebAssembly (WASI preview 1)
  Built by: VMware Wasm Labs, webassembly-language-runtimes,
            release python/3.12.0+20231211-040d5a6
  Source:   https://github.com/vmware-labs/webassembly-language-runtimes/releases/download/python%2F3.12.0%2B20231211-040d5a6/python-3.12.0.wasm
  Size:     26267204 bytes
  SHA-256:  e5dc5a398b07b54ea8fdb503bf68fb583d533f10ec3f930963e02b9505f7a763

The file is downloaded only when the package is built (fetch_runtime.py) and is
checked against the size and SHA-256 above; the build fails on any mismatch.

