Statically linked components
----------------------------

Importing their modules inside the runtime shows that the binary contains the
following libraries (zlib, bz2, _sqlite3, _decimal, pyexpat). They are covered by
their own licences, which the CPython licence file does not reproduce:

* zlib (zlib License)
* bzip2 / libbzip2 (bzip2 licence, BSD-style)
* SQLite (public domain)
* libmpdec (BSD 2-Clause), used by _decimal
* Expat (MIT), used by pyexpat
* wasi-libc (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, plus MIT and other permissive
  licences for parts derived from musl and others)

VMware's NOTICE states that such subcomponents keep their own licence terms.
Before publishing, check this list against the build's own records.

The Python code in this package (safeloadai_runtime/__init__.py and the build
helpers) is part of the safeloadai project.
